[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1141.83, "timestamp": "00:19:01", "text": "工作之类的。在那里定居。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1144.39, "timestamp": "00:19:04", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。是的。 [清嗓子] 不，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1146.63, "timestamp": "00:19:06", "text": "知道。我打算去那里。去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1161.27, "timestamp": "00:19:21", "text": "个人电脑。来，听我说。让我来做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1166.549, "timestamp": "00:19:26", "text": "你工作，这样我才能开始我的工作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1170.07, "timestamp": "00:19:30", "text": "溪流。不，我总是以“我是什么”开头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1172.453, "timestamp": "00:19:32", "text": "怎么说？我的直播差点就开始了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1173.029, "timestamp": "00:19:33", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1175.99, "timestamp": "00:19:35", "text": "不，我总是以“我在说什么？”开头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1178.07, "timestamp": "00:19:38", "text": "多少"}]